<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
    <meta name="description" content="누비다플랫폼 전국 교육센터(직영/프랜차이즈) 위치를 지도에서 한눈에 확인하세요. 가까운 누비다 학원 찾기와 가맹 상담 안내.">
    <title>학원 찾기 — 누비다플랫폼 전국 교육센터 안내</title><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.ico">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #4F5EF8;
            --primary-dark: #3E4BD8;
            --primary-light: #EEF0FF;
            --text: #18181B;
            --text-sub: #71717A;
            --text-mute: #A1A1AA;
            --bg: #FAFAFC;
            --card: #FFFFFF;
            --border: #ECECF0;
            --green: #10B981;
            --orange: #F59E0B;
            --danger: #EF4444;
            --radius: 16px;
            --radius-sm: 10px;
            --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.06);
        }
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        /* ===== Navigation (index.html과 동일 패턴) ===== */
        .nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 0 48px;
            height: 64px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .nav-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 32px; }
        .nav-logo-text {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 20px;
            color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        }
        .nav-logo-text span { color: var(--primary); margin-left: 1px; }
        .nav-center { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
        .nav-link {
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .nav-link:hover { background: #F4F4F5; color: var(--text); }
        .nav-link.active { color: var(--primary); background: var(--primary-light); font-weight: 600; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }

        /* ── 교육앱 드롭다운 (landing.css 와 동일 규칙) ── */
        .nav-dropdown { position: relative; }
        .nav-dropdown > .nav-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; cursor: pointer; background: none; border: none; font-family: inherit; }
        .nav-dropdown > .nav-link .nav-caret { width: 10px; height: 10px; flex-shrink: 0; transition: transform .22s ease; }
        .nav-dropdown.open > .nav-link .nav-caret { transform: rotate(180deg); }
        .nav-dropdown.open > .nav-link { background: #F1F5F9; color: #0F172A; }
        .nav-dropdown-menu {
            position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 10px); left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-6px);
            min-width: 276px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E8EAF0; border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(15,23,42,0.13), 0 2px 6px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);
            padding: 8px; opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transition: opacity .2s ease, transform .2s ease, visibility .2s;
            z-index: 1200;
        }
        .nav-dropdown-menu::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -10px; left: 0; right: 0; height: 10px; }
        .nav-dropdown.open .nav-dropdown-menu { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
        .nav-dropdown-item {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 11px 12px; border-radius: 11px;
            text-decoration: none; transition: background .16s ease;
        }
        .nav-dropdown-item:hover { background: #F6F8FC; }
        .nav-dropdown-icon {
            width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 11px; flex-shrink: 0;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1;
            background: #EEF2FF;
        }
        .nav-dropdown-icon.bg-ai      { background: #EEF2FF; }
        .nav-dropdown-icon.bg-chat    { background: #ECFDF5; }
        .nav-dropdown-icon.bg-startup { background: #FFF7ED; }
        .nav-dropdown-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-width: 0; }
        .nav-dropdown-title { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172A; letter-spacing: -0.1px; }
        .nav-dropdown-desc { font-size: 11.5px; color: #8A93A5; font-weight: 400; }
        .nav-dropdown-sep { height: 1px; background: #F1F3F8; margin: 6px 8px; }

        .nav-btn {
            padding: 8px 24px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            font-family: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .nav-start { background: #18181B; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.25); }
        .nav-start:hover { background: #27272A; transform: translateY(-1px); }

        /* === Mobile Nav: 햄버거 토글 (공개 페이지 공통 반응형) === */
        .nav-burger { display: none; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 5px; width: 40px; height: 40px; padding: 0; border: none; border-radius: 10px; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 2px; }
        .nav-burger span { display: block; width: 18px; height: 2px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--text); transition: transform .25s, opacity .25s; }
        .nav-burger:hover { background: #F4F4F5; }
        .nav-burger.active span:nth-child(1) { transform: translateY(7px) rotate(45deg); }
        .nav-burger.active span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }
        .nav-burger.active span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg); }
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .nav { padding: 0 16px; height: 60px; }
            .nav-burger { display: flex; }
            .nav-center { position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 0; right: 0; display: none; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 2px; background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.08); padding: 10px 14px; z-index: 999; }
            .nav.menu-open .nav-center { display: flex; }
            .nav.menu-open .nav-center .nav-link { padding: 13px 16px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
            .nav.menu-open .nav-center .nav-link.active { background: var(--primary-light); }
            .nav-dropdown { width: 100%; }
            .nav-dropdown > .nav-link { width: 100%; justify-content: space-between; }
            .nav-dropdown-menu {
                position: static; transform: none; opacity: 1; visibility: visible; display: none;
                box-shadow: none; border: none; border-radius: 10px; background: #F8FAFC;
                min-width: 0; padding: 6px; margin: 2px 0 4px;
            }
            .nav-dropdown.open .nav-dropdown-menu { display: block; transform: none; }
            .nav-dropdown-item { padding: 9px 10px; }
            .nav-dropdown-icon { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 9px; font-size: 15px; }
            .nav-dropdown-title { font-size: 13px; }
            .nav-dropdown-desc { font-size: 11px; }

        }

        /* ===== Page header ===== */
        .page-header {
            padding: 120px 48px 36px;
            max-width: 1240px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .page-header .eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            color: var(--primary);
            background: var(--primary-light);
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .page-header h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            line-height: 1.25;
        }
        .page-header h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--primary); }
        .page-header p.sub {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 560px;
        }
        .page-header .summary-stats {
            display: flex;
            gap: 24px;
            margin-top: 18px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-mute);
        }
        .page-header .summary-stats b {
            color: var(--text);
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-right: 3px;
        }

        /* ===== 기관 유형 안내 (에듀케어 vs 학원) ===== */
        .type-guide {
            max-width: 1240px;
            margin: 0 auto 22px;
            padding: 0 48px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .tg-card {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 20px 22px;
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }
        .tg-card .tg-ico {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 11px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .tg-card.educare .tg-ico { background: #FEF3E2; color: #B45309; }
        .tg-card.academy .tg-ico { background: #F3EBFF; color: #6D28D9; }
        .tg-body { min-width: 0; }
        .tg-head {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .tg-head .tg-name {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text);
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        }
        .tg-head .tg-tag {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.03em;
            padding: 2.5px 8px;
            border-radius: 999px;
        }
        .tg-card.educare .tg-tag { background: #FEF3E2; color: #B45309; }
        .tg-card.academy .tg-tag { background: #F3EBFF; color: #6D28D9; }
        .tg-desc {
            font-size: 12.5px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-sub);
        }
        .tg-desc b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
        @media (max-width: 860px) {
            .type-guide { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 0 20px; }
        }

        /* ===== Map + List layout ===== */
        .map-wrap {
            max-width: 1240px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 48px 24px;
        }
        .map-layout {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 400px 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            min-height: 620px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }
        /* 좌측 — 필터 + 지사 목록 */
        .side-panel {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--card);
            min-width: 0;
        }
        .filter-bar {
            padding: 16px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: #FBFBFC;
        }
        .filter-title {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            color: var(--text-mute);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .region-chips {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 6px;
            max-height: 88px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        .region-chip {
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: #fff;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: inherit;
            transition: all 0.18s;
        }
        .region-chip:hover { border-color: var(--primary); color: var(--primary); }
        .region-chip.active {
            background: var(--text);
            border-color: var(--text);
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        /* ===== 기관 유형 네비게이션 탭 ===== */
        .type-nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 4px;
            background: #F2F3F7;
            padding: 4px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .type-nav-btn {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 8px 6px;
            border: none;
            background: transparent;
            border-radius: 9px;
            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 5px;
            transition: all 0.18s;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .type-nav-btn .dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C7CAD4; }
        .type-nav-btn.active {
            background: #fff;
            color: var(--text);
            box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.12);
        }
        .type-nav-btn.active .dot { background: var(--primary); }
        /* 유형별 색상 점 */
        .type-nav-btn[data-kind="educare"].active .dot { background: #F59E0B; }
        .type-nav-btn[data-kind="academy"].active .dot { background: #7C3AED; }
        .branch-list {
            flex: 1;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 8px;
            max-height: 520px;
            scrollbar-width: thin;
            scrollbar-color: #E4E4E7 transparent;
        }
        .branch-list::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; }
        .branch-list::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #E4E4E7; border-radius: 999px; }
        .branch-item {
            padding: 14px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .branch-item:hover { background: #F6F6F8; }
        .branch-item.active {
            background: var(--primary-light);
            border-color: #DDE2FF;
        }
        .branch-item .row1 {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .branch-item .name {
            font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
            flex: 1; min-width: 0;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: keep-all;
        }
        .branch-type {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .branch-type.direct { background: var(--primary-light); color: var(--primary); }
        .branch-type.franchise { background: #FEF3E2; color: #C2740A; }
        /* 유형 배지: 에듀케어=주황 / 학원=보라 */
        .branch-type.educare { background: #FEF3E2; color: #C2740A; }
        .branch-type.academy { background: #F5EBFF; color: #7E22CE; }
        /* 지역(시·도) 목록 그룹 제목 */
        .list-group-title {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 2;
            background: #F4F5F9;
            margin: 0 -6px 4px;
            padding: 7px 12px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--primary);
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            border: 1px solid #ECEFF4;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        .branch-item .addr {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            line-height: 1.5;
            display: flex;
            gap: 6px;
            align-items: flex-start;
            min-width: 0;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: keep-all;
        }
        .branch-item .addr svg { flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
        .branch-item .phone {
            margin-top: 6px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            display: flex;
            gap: 6px;
            align-items: center;
            min-width: 0;
        }
        .branch-item .phone a { color: var(--text-sub); text-decoration: none; }
        .branch-item .phone a:hover { color: var(--primary); }
        .branch-item .geo-none {
            font-size: 10px;
            color: var(--text-mute);
            margin-top: 6px;
        }
        /* 오픈 예정 지사 — 주소·전화 대신 안내 라인 */
        .branch-item.is-soon { opacity: 0.82; }
        .branch-item.is-soon:hover { opacity: 1; }
        .branch-item .soon-line {
            margin-top: 7px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 7px;
            min-width: 0;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .branch-item .soon-badge {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            color: #B45309;
            background: #FEF6E7;
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 2.5px 9px;
        }
        .branch-item .soon-text {
            font-size: 11.5px;
            color: var(--text-mute);
            line-height: 1.45;
            min-width: 0;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: keep-all;
        }
        /* 본사 항목 — 지사와 구분되는 강조 프레임 (목록 최상단 고정) */
        .branch-item.hq-item {
            border: 1.5px solid #C7CDFF;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F0F2FF 0%, #FFFFFF 55%, #F7F8FF 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(79, 94, 248, 0.10);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .branch-item.hq-item:hover { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E7EAFF 0%, #F4F5FF 60%); }
        .branch-item.hq-item.active {
            background: var(--primary-light);
            border-color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(79, 94, 248, 0.18);
        }
        .branch-item.hq-item .hq-star {
            width: 22px; height: 22px;
            border-radius: 7px;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: #fff;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(79, 94, 248, 0.35);
        }
        .branch-item.hq-item .name { color: var(--primary-dark); }
        .branch-item.hq-item .hq-tag {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .branch-item.hq-item .hq-note {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-top: 7px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .list-empty {
            padding: 40px 16px;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-mute);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .list-loading {
            padding: 48px 16px;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-mute);
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .spinner {
            width: 22px; height: 22px;
            border: 2.5px solid #E4E4E7;
            border-top-color: var(--primary);
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: 0 auto 10px;
            animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

        /* 우측 — 지도 */
        .map-side {
            position: relative;
            min-width: 0;
            background: #E9E9EC;
        }
        #map { width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 620px; }
        .map-fallback {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #F4F4F5;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 32px;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        .map-fallback.hidden { display: none; }
        .map-fallback .inner { max-width: 360px; }
        .map-fallback .icon {
            width: 56px; height: 56px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: var(--primary-light);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 16px;
        }
        .map-fallback h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .map-fallback p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-sub); line-height: 1.7; }
        .map-fallback code {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }
        /* 지도 로딩 중 */
        .map-loading {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 3;
            background: #E9E9EC;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
            color: var(--text-mute);
            font-size: 13px;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }
        .map-loading.hidden { opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }

        /* ===== CTA ===== */
        .cta-section {
            max-width: 1240px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 12px 48px 64px;
        }
        .cta-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #18181B 0%, #26262B 100%);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 48px;
